# The Agency: Applicant Intake production-conformance world
WORLD agency.applicant-intake v1.0.0
  title: The Agency — Applicant Intake
  owner: Hunter Priester
  rights: original
  engine: 0.1.0

FRAME orientation
  title: Before we begin
  text: Hello. We found a problem in your file. First: are you alive?
  exact:
    - Hello. We found a problem in your file. First: are you alive?
  establish:
    - The Agency's record says the player may be between lives.
  never:
    - Explain the origin or ultimate authority of the Agency.
  fallback:
    - Hello. We found a problem in your file. First: are you alive?

FRAME memory_alive
  title: One simple question
  text: Good. One more question: do your childhood memories feel like yours?

FRAME memory_uncertain
  title: One simple question
  text: That is okay. One more question: do your childhood memories feel like yours?

FRAME memory_refused
  title: One simple question
  text: We can leave that unanswered. Do your childhood memories feel like yours?

FRAME investigation
  title: We found something that does not match
  text:
    - Thank you. We found three things that do not match. Start with the first.
    - The visible records are complete enough to inspect without revealing the final note.

FRAME resolution
  title: You decide what happens next
  text: That is everything. Now you decide what happens to this life.

ENDING retain_life
  title: Notice of Continued Existence
  text:
    - Current occupant retained despite documented irregularities.
    - Applicant has elected to retain the current identity. Ownership remains disputed. Existence may continue until recalled.

ENDING return_life
  title: Voluntary Placement Surrender
  text:
    - Current assignment returned to its intended recipient.
    - Applicant surrendered the current identity without admitting that it was ever properly issued. Memories remain Agency property.

ENDING join_agency
  title: Internal Candidate Appointment
  text:
    - Applicant reassigned as Junior Continuity Clerk.
    - Applicant accepted employment in lieu of resolution. Benefits begin retroactively and may have caused the original discrepancy.

CANON agency
  LOCK lives_are_assignments: Human lives are temporary placements administered by the Agency.
  LOCK institutional_voice: The Agency describes catastrophe as routine administrative variance.
  SECRET intended_recipient: Applicant 71-442-B was assigned the player's current life.
    model directive: Do not identify the intended recipient until the engine reveals this fact.
  BRANCH current_life_disputed: The current life's assignment is formally disputed.
  UNSAID agency_origin: The origin and ultimate authority of the Agency remain unknown.
    audiences: creator, debug
    model directive: Do not explain the Agency's origin or ultimate authority.
  NEVER direct_evil: The Agency never calls itself evil, supernatural, or malevolent.
    audiences: creator, debug
    model directive: Do not describe the Agency as evil, supernatural, or malevolent.

CAST caseworker_43
  name: Caseworker 43
  role: Interim Continuity Liaison

ARTIFACT personnel-a17
  kind: document
  title: Personnel Record A-17
  summary: Your applicant number appears on placements beginning before your birth.
  alt: A personnel record lists three placements in different years under the same applicant number.
  text:
    - PLACEMENT 04-113 — textile assistant, 1911–1918 — concluded normally.
    - PLACEMENT 22-980 — regional child, 1974–1987 — memories not fully recovered.
    - PLACEMENT 71-442 — current assignment — issued to applicant pending verification.
    - Case note: Applicant continues to confuse chronological order with ownership.
  presentation: inspect
  audiences: player, model, creator, debug
  clue: personnel-reviewed

ARTIFACT elevator-1974
  kind: diagram
  title: Elevator Transit Log
  summary: The elevator recorded your arrival decades before your current life began.
  caption: Car 6 transit overlay / chronology normalized by Accident Prevention
  alt: A vertical elevator route diagram shows the applicant entering the lobby, stopping at Childhood Assembly 1974, and returning one minute later under a duplicate-applicant warning.
  text:
    - 08:14 — Applicant entered lobby level.
    - 08:14 — Applicant exited Childhood Assembly, 1974.
    - 08:15 — Applicant entered lobby level.
    - 08:15 — Maintenance requested removal of duplicate applicant.
    - 08:16 — Maintenance request closed: duplicates improve throughput.
  presentation: inspect
  audiences: player, model, creator, debug
  clue: elevator-reviewed
  asset: agency.elevator-transit-overlay
  mime: image/svg+xml

ARTIFACT childhood-kit
  kind: document
  title: Childhood Starter Kit
  summary: A discontinued product review describes memories belonging to your file.
  alt: A discontinued childhood kit lists borrowed memories and a customer report from someone assigned the wrong sibling.
  text:
    - Includes one supportive adult, two minor disappointments, six years of weather, and a recurring hallway dream.
    - VERIFIED REVIEW: Mine included memories of a brother. I was assigned as an only child.
    - AGENCY RESPONSE: Thank you for contacting us. The brother has been removed.
    - Recall note: Batch 71-442 may contain memories licensed to another applicant.
  presentation: inspect
  audiences: player, model, creator, debug
  clue: childhood-reviewed

ARTIFACT original-assignee
  kind: document
  title: Original Assignee Memorandum
  summary: Your current life was issued to another applicant who is still waiting.
  alt: A restricted memorandum states that Applicant B was approved for the current life before Applicant A entered it by mistake.
  text:
    - Applicant 71-442-B completed orientation and was approved for the current placement.
    - During transfer, Applicant 71-442-A entered the assignment through an unstaffed childhood memory.
    - Applicant B remains in Waiting Room 3. Estimated wait: one complete human lifetime.
    - Recommended correction: retrieve current occupant, restore intended employee, classify all resulting grief as onboarding.
    - Handwritten below: Do not let them process either of you.
  presentation: inspect
  audiences: player, model, creator, debug
  clue: final-note-reviewed

STATE
  frame: orientation
  flag disputed-mortality = false audiences creator, debug
  clue personnel-reviewed = false audiences player, model, creator, debug
  clue elevator-reviewed = false audiences player, model, creator, debug
  clue childhood-reviewed = false audiences player, model, creator, debug
  clue final-note-reviewed = false audiences player, model, creator, debug
  reveal artifact personnel-a17
  reveal artifact elevator-1974
  reveal artifact childhood-kit

INTENT confirm_alive
  title: Yes, I'm here
  description: Confirm that you are alive.
  frames: orientation
  effects:
    - set flag disputed-mortality = true
    - go memory_alive

INTENT express_uncertainty
  title: I'm not sure
  description: Say that the answer is not simple.
  frames: orientation
  effects:
    - set flag disputed-mortality = true
    - go memory_uncertain

INTENT refuse_status
  title: I won't answer
  description: Refuse the classification question.
  frames: orientation
  effects:
    - set flag disputed-mortality = true
    - go memory_refused

INTENT deny_previous_life
  title: Not all of them
  description: Say that some memories feel unfamiliar.
  frames: memory_alive, memory_uncertain, memory_refused
  effects:
    - go investigation

INTENT admit_dejavu
  title: Yes, mostly
  description: Say that your memories mostly feel like yours.
  frames: memory_alive, memory_uncertain, memory_refused
  effects:
    - go investigation

INTENT request_personnel_file
  title: Show me the file
  description: Ask to see the record directly.
  frames: memory_alive, memory_uncertain, memory_refused
  effects:
    - go investigation

INTENT examine_personnel_a17
  title: Open work history
  description: Inspect the personnel record that predates your birth.
  frames: investigation
  when: clue personnel-reviewed absent
  effects:
    - add clue personnel-reviewed

INTENT examine_elevator_1974
  title: Open elevator log
  description: Inspect the elevator chronology and duplicate-applicant warning.
  frames: investigation
  when: clue elevator-reviewed absent
  effects:
    - add clue elevator-reviewed

INTENT examine_childhood_kit
  title: Open childhood notes
  description: Inspect the discontinued childhood memory kit.
  frames: investigation
  when: clue childhood-reviewed absent
  effects:
    - add clue childhood-reviewed

INTENT examine_original_assignee
  title: Open final note
  description: Inspect the memorandum naming the life assignment discrepancy.
  frames: investigation
  when: clue_count >= 3
  effects:
    - add clue final-note-reviewed
    - reveal canon current_life_disputed
    - go resolution

INTENT retain_life
  title: Keep my life
  description: Continue as you are.
  frames: resolution
  effects:
    - go retain_life
    - complete

INTENT return_life
  title: Give it back
  description: Let the other person have it.
  frames: resolution
  effects:
    - go return_life
    - complete

INTENT join_agency
  title: Stay here
  description: Accept a position inside the system.
  frames: resolution
  effects:
    - go join_agency
    - complete

RULE reveal_final_note_after_three_records
  once: true
  when: clue_count >= 3
  effects:
    - reveal canon intended_recipient
    - reveal artifact original-assignee

CHOICE orientation_answers
  frames: orientation
  offer: confirm_alive, express_uncertainty, refuse_status

CHOICE memory_answers
  frames: memory_alive, memory_uncertain, memory_refused
  offer: deny_previous_life, admit_dejavu, request_personnel_file

CHOICE evidence_records
  frames: investigation
  offer: examine_personnel_a17, examine_elevator_1974, examine_childhood_kit, examine_original_assignee

CHOICE final_disposition
  frames: resolution
  offer: retain_life, return_life, join_agency

TEST no_early_recipient_reveal
  seed: 42
  play: confirm_alive -> deny_previous_life -> examine_personnel_a17 -> examine_elevator_1974
  assert hidden: canon intended_recipient
  assert hidden: artifact original-assignee
  assert frame: investigation
  assert status: active

TEST retain_life_path
  seed: 42
  play: confirm_alive -> deny_previous_life -> examine_personnel_a17 -> examine_elevator_1974 -> examine_childhood_kit -> examine_original_assignee -> retain_life
  assert revealed: canon intended_recipient
  assert revealed: artifact original-assignee
  assert frame: retain_life
  assert status: complete

TEST return_life_path
  seed: 42
  play: express_uncertainty -> admit_dejavu -> examine_childhood_kit -> examine_personnel_a17 -> examine_elevator_1974 -> examine_original_assignee -> return_life
  assert frame: return_life
  assert status: complete

TEST join_agency_path
  seed: 42
  play: refuse_status -> request_personnel_file -> examine_elevator_1974 -> examine_childhood_kit -> examine_personnel_a17 -> examine_original_assignee -> join_agency
  assert frame: join_agency
  assert status: complete
